4020793.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-21T02:14:51+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-124020995,imgsize-1329123.cms"/></item><item><title>‘Defending our diversity’: California bans face masks for law enforcement, federal agents</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/124020902.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/defence-of-our-diversity-california-bans-law-enforcement-face-coverings-first-us-state-with-such-law/articleshow/124020902.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/defence-of-our-diversity-california-bans-law-enforcement-face-coverings-first-us-state-with-such-law/articleshow/124020902.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-21T02:04:36+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-124020977,imgsize-80034.cms"/></item><item><title>Ukraine President Zelenskyy hopeful of meeting Donald Trump next week</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/124020892.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/ukraine-president-zelenskyy-hopeful-of-meeting-donald-trump-next-week/articleshow/124020892.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/ukraine-president-zelenskyy-hopeful-of-meeting-donald-trump-next-week/articleshow/124020892.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-21T01:22:36+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-124020896,imgsize-1095805.cms"/></item><item><title>Three dead as Russia launches large-scale attack on Ukraine</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspa